# Collector identity material must never be committed (default state dir is
# outside the repo; this guards an in-repo TERMINUS_STATE_DIR override).
*.pem
# Committed test fixtures are the exception: a static, already-expired self-signed
# cert + throwaway key used to exercise the TLS expiry path portably.
!test/fixtures/expired-cert.pem
!test/fixtures/expired-key.pem
device-token
identity.json
state.lock
